         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nWe recommend reading the previous texts first to enhance comprehension:\n\n- **I live on the planet...**: It is not only time that has different counts. When we speak of the planet we live on, we also have different ideas about it (<htcite0>)\n- **The Size of the Earth**: Text describing the first measurements of the planet's size (<htcite1>)",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "22080ce2-a428-493e-84f9-aebdbed90b0c",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "I live on the planet...",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "7c7a3259-88e0-47b8-920c-9a5baacdb212",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "The Size of the Earth",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "",
